                    <div class="bg-white border border-n2 p-4 text-center">
                        <p class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-forest">4.9</p>
                        <p class="font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate mt-1">Rating</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <form id="talkForm" class="reveal-card bg-white border border-n2 p-7 md:p-10 space-y-5 relative">
                <p
                    class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-huge text-slate absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-[#f5f8f4] px-2">
                    Project brief</p>
                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <label class="block text-sm">Name <span class="text-ember">*</span>
                        <input required name="name"
                            class="mt-2 w-full border border-n2 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-forest transition text-sm bg-[#fbfdf9]" />
                    </label>
                    <label class="block text-sm">Email <span class="text-ember">*</span>
                        <input required type="email" name="email"
                            class="mt-2 w-full border border-n2 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-forest transition text-sm bg-[#fbfdf9]" />
                    </label>
                </div>
                <label class="block text-sm">Company
                    <input name="company"
                        class="mt-2 w-full border border-n2 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-forest transition text-sm bg-[#fbfdf9]" />
                </label>
                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <label class="block text-sm">Service needed
                        <select name="service"
                            class="mt-2 w-full border border-n2 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-forest bg-[#fbfdf9] text-sm">
                            <option>Website design & development</option>
                            <option>Brand identity</option>
                            <option>Product / app</option>
                            <option>Growth & SEO</option>
                            <option>Not sure yet</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>
                    <label class="block text-sm">Budget
                        <select name="budget"
                            class="mt-2 w-full border border-n2 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-forest bg-[#fbfdf9] text-sm">
                            <option>Less than $10k</option>
                            <option>$10k–$20k</option>
                            <option>$20k–$40k</option>
                            <option>$40k–$80k</option>
                            <option>$80k+</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>
                </div>
                <label class="block text-sm">Tell us more
                    <textarea name="message" rows="4"
                        class="mt-2 w-full border border-n2 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-forest transition text-sm bg-[#fbfdf9]"></textarea>
                </label>
                <button type="submit" data-cursor="hover"
                    class="btn-square w-full bg-ink text-white font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] py-4">
                    <span class="fill"></span><span class="relative">Book a strategy call →</span>
                </button>
                <p id="formNote" class="hidden text-sm text-moss font-semibold">Thanks — we'll be in touch within 24
                    hours.</p>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section id="faqs" class="py-20 md:py-24">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <p class="reveal-up font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-huge text-moss">08 — FAQ</p>
                <h2 class="reveal-up font-display font-extrabold uppercase text-4xl md:text-5xl mt-3">Still have
                    questions?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <details open class="reveal-card bg-white border border-n2">
                    <summary
                        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-5 font-display font-bold uppercase text-base cursor-pointer">
                        What makes a Tech Hodu website effective?
                        <span
                            class="faq-plus shrink-0 grid place-items-center w-9 h-9 border border-forest text-forest font-mono text-lg">+</span>
                    </summary>
                    <p class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-slategrn leading-relaxed">Clear messaging, an intuitive buyer
                        journey and design that proves value fast. We optimize for conversions — demos, inquiries and
                        sales — not just aesthetics.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="reveal-card bg-white border border-n2">
                    <summary
                        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-5 font-display font-bold uppercase text-base cursor-pointer">
                        How do you approach a new engagement?
                        <span
                            class="faq-plus shrink-0 grid place-items-center w-9 h-9 border border-forest text-forest font-mono text-lg">+</span>
                    </summary>
                    <p class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-slategrn leading-relaxed">We start with product, audience and
                        business goals. Then positioning, wireframes, design and a build your marketing team can
                        actually run without engineering.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="reveal-card bg-white border border-n2">
                    <summary
                        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-5 font-display font-bold uppercase text-base cursor-pointer">
                        How long does a typical project take?
                        <span
                            class="faq-plus shrink-0 grid place-items-center w-9 h-9 border border-forest text-forest font-mono text-lg">+</span>
                    </summary>
                    <p class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-slategrn leading-relaxed">Most custom websites ship in 8–12 weeks.
                        Complexity and content can shift that — you'll get a week-by-week plan at kickoff so
                        expectations stay clear.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="reveal-card bg-white border border-n2">
                    <summary
                        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-5 font-display font-bold uppercase text-base cursor-pointer">
                        Do you work as an extension of our team?
                        <span
                            class="faq-plus shrink-0 grid place-items-center w-9 h-9 border border-forest text-forest font-mono text-lg">+</span>
                    </summary>
                    <p class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-slategrn leading-relaxed">Yes. A dedicated squad and a single point
                        of contact — more reliable than freelancers, more agile than a typical holding-company agency.
                    </p>
                </details>
                <details class="reveal-card bg-white border border-n2">
                    <summary
                        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-5 font-display font-bold uppercase text-base cursor-pointer">
                        What happens after launch?
                        <span
                            class="faq-plus shrink-0 grid place-items-center w-9 h-9 border border-forest text-forest font-mono text-lg">+</span>
                    </summary>
                    <p class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-slategrn leading-relaxed">We can stay on for CRO, content, SEO and
                        performance. Launch is the start of the growth loop, not the finish line.</p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

